OL,3,GNEWSA'I was nervous before my first
OL,4,Atrain ride, but now I'm confident'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy who had never travelled
OL,7,Fby train said his fears had been eased
OL,8,Fand he felt calm and confident after
OL,9,Fgoing on a supported first journey.
OL,11,FMichael, 16, joined fellow pupils from
OL,12,FFelixstowe School for the "try a train"
OL,13,Fsession run by Suffolk County Council
OL,14,F(SCC).
OL,16,F"It's my first time on a train, and I
OL,17,Ffelt a bit nervous, but I'm OK with it
OL,18,Fnow - it's a lot calmer and nicer [than
OL,19,Fexpected]," he said.
